title = AK-47
description = The AK-47, full name Avtomat Kalashnikova 1947, officially known as the Avtomat Kalashnikova, is an assault rifle chambered for the 7.62×39mm cartridge. Developed in the Soviet Union by Russian small-arms designer Mikhail Kalashnikov, it is the originating firearm of the Kalashnikov family of rifles.
